      <function type="NSString*" name="_TTIOJsonEscape">
        <arg type="NSString*">s</arg>
        <desc>
          JSON-escape a string per RFC 8259 §7 (no \uXXXX
          for non-ASCII — emit UTF-8 verbatim; only escape
          mandatory `"`, `\`, and control characters
